  "question": {
    "text": "The radius of fifth orbit of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Li</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_______</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Take: radius of hydrogen atom<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></mover></math>",
    "image": null
