  "correctValue": "425",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula to calculate the radius of Lithium-ion is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>Li</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>Z</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) to calculate the required radius of the ion.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>425</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
